{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"も～～～（；＿；）！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからのコメント読んで\nめっちゃ号泣しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も何回も\n言葉に出しながら、読みました。\n胸に響きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうほんと\nこれ以上みさを泣かせんでくれ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4578832/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。とか\nそんなこと言ってますが\nほんとにほんとにありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しんけん励ましてくれるコメントから\nふふって笑っちゃうコメント\nなによりみさのこと想って\n一生懸命言葉考えてくれたことが\n本当にうれしかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅうも書いてたけど....。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドアンダー！！\nやってやろうじゃないのぉ～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜を支えて 乃木坂を支える！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4578832/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※若月と衛藤\nアホではありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のレッスン後。\n全身が筋肉痛に襲われながら\nみんなで汗かいて練習中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24日の名古屋での握手会が\n楽しみすぎてウハウハです。\nどうしよどうしよ！\n何話す！？(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4578832/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てくださるみなさんも\nメンバーにとっても\n楽しい楽しい一日になりますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はみゅうみゅうの家に\n泊まりきてる！\n前も行ったことあるんだけど\nみゅうみゅうの部屋は意外にも\nかわいい女の子らしい部屋なんよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4578832/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハートのクッションとかあるし♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき録画してたテレビで\n中華街？のソフトクリーム\n紹介しちょって\nめっちゃ食べたくなったなう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンゴーソフトとか\n絶対美味しいやろっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4578832/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～しんけん行きたい～～\n誰か連れてってく (ry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4578832/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまた明日！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみさみ齋藤あすか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑あすかに\n何かないかな～？って聞いたら\nこれが返ってきたんで（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4578832/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照れながら言ってきた。\n激かわ。"}],"source":"archive"}